{"title":"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the set of numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e804a451303565b1f6221296747c2e8b9a102f07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1, 10, 10^2, 10^3, \\ldots, 10^{10}\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"192\" height=\"19\" />. The ratio of the largest element of the set to the sum of the other ten elements of the set is closest to which integer?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0efe7def27ddcb9a33c2786bfd6adac6d10ef2b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 11 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)} 101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"379\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The requested ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/f/f8f5b2d7b0d24f1a3716487e0523cc14dafc5bcb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{10^{10}}{10^9 + 10^8 + \\ldots + 10 + 1}.\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"40\" /> Using the formula for a geometric series, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a0f26f9090148b1838f22b0393a29287d0cde87.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10^9 + 10^8 + \\ldots + 10 + 1 = \\dfrac{10^{10} - 1}{10 - 1} = \\dfrac{10^{10} - 1}{9},\\]\" width=\"374\" height=\"39\" /> which is very close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/e/fee21bd1dcdc3881ca63647d82abda4ec45dddf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{10^{10}}{9},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"40\" height=\"39\" /> so the ratio is very close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/0/180d1f63ccd6f62ac54b5d255f9470d2ab257416.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B) \\ } 9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The problem asks for the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/f/f8f5b2d7b0d24f1a3716487e0523cc14dafc5bcb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{10^{10}}{10^9 + 10^8 + \\ldots + 10 + 1}.\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"40\" /> Written in base 10, we can find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/7/667cd616004767bc865e3eaad5fe7a62995a57e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^9 + 10^8 + \\ldots + 10 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"187\" height=\"16\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a9a55f25340c741c3739c54a9f3973f868e075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1111111111.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"12\" /> Long division gives us the answer to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/0/180d1f63ccd6f62ac54b5d255f9470d2ab257416.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B) \\ } 9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p>Alternate finish: multiply the denominator by 9 and notice that it is 1 less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8c24b9bb481b4086030eadf9f45d4f154ec547e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" />. So the answer is very very close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717950789d8fcf19750ff1af386a7f1c17541720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B) } 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"49\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~JH. L\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f94e4e7687b83fe3fc8de5422870c86ea949df39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)=\\dfrac{10^n}{1+10+10^2+10^3+\\cdots+10^{n-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"321\" height=\"40\" />. We are approximating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/0/940ecf6711969c95460f0d5a7e47489c7a131c76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"45\" height=\"20\" />. Trying several small values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> gives answers very close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/e/f0e6dbd534ad542585ec62906f8ecb96e4b58e03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}~9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"30\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/1/2e17de54d0cab210cadf54a7b409fec1859bf72d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d81cf7d1cc4a2b13b507ae070fdccfc6b29bbff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2)=\\dfrac{100}{11}\\approx9.09.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"153\" height=\"38\" /> \n~Technodoggo\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B\">2011 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2011 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017145828\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 196/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2322/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 156/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3764/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.242      1 -total\n 61.53%    9.379      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 37.29%    5.684      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9446:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017145828 and revision id 197716. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}